{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>吳千語（Karena）在2023年底與百億富三代施伯雄（Brian）結婚，婚後她依然努力工作，更進軍直播帶貨行列，成為新一代「帶貨一姐」！日前吳千語就在小紅書進行直播帶貨，由下午3點直播到翌日凌晨3點，直至凌晨4點才返屋企。未料一踏入家門，眼前景象令她當場感動落淚，原來閨密好友馬天佑（Mayao）、麥少瑜（Fiona）及Tiffany Poon（潘美諺）暗中造訪其豪宅，將整個客廳及玄關樓梯佈置成極其震撼的玫瑰花海，為她送上超奢華的生日驚喜！</p><figure><img alt=\"吳千語（Karena）與「百億富三代」施伯雄（Brian）在意大利舉行婚禮。（微博@Karena吳千語）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250118/957385710329925632128346.jpeg/FW5dODym1oHSVSq8FT_Iaa_9HwjXUDtMlgh8YpYIfGI\"/><figcaption>吳千語（Karena）與「百億富三代」施伯雄（Brian）在意大利舉行婚禮。（微博@Karena吳千語）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Sweet！（微博@施伯雄Brian）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251016/1055544847525482496096124.jpeg/iPNGCN35F9tAr5B95qucxov8e5OjRAqYumo34LpqN-A\"/><figcaption>Sweet！（微博@施伯雄Brian）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"登對。（IG@karena_ngs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189619176101515264452107.jpeg/21vrEdgu5z1A8-_k0_HW0dlT8bgW6_mPTBMsc0wTLHM\"/><figcaption>登對。（IG@karena_ngs）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"登對。（IG@karena_ngs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189619173668687872638415.jpeg/1KY0K7FWt7tt9DzMamMu8uJg3wXOJdJPBS9t7gUvbe4\"/><figcaption>登對。（IG@karena_ngs）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Fit。（IG@karena_ngs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189619170564771840903526.jpeg/R1Wpim4mfW0NIWeOAZqax5RtlbicPFbFJLsVPyS7FT8\"/><figcaption>Fit。（IG@karena_ngs）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日前吳千語就在小紅書進行直播帶貨，由下午3點直播到翌日凌晨3點。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189619880219906048703512.jpeg/UYNZgAntWiMAVl-0BUy_yhB_ILvIqVlF0I3iFNCN4hQ\"/><figcaption>日前吳千語就在小紅書進行直播帶貨，由下午3點直播到翌日凌晨3點。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"日前吳千語就在小紅書進行直播帶貨，由下午3點直播到翌日凌晨3點。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189619168295522304453128.jpeg/NVK-zbQUz5_gHXgT6-HhjbWQxUl_iMO7RLF2R0Sxdkc\"/><figcaption>日前吳千語就在小紅書進行直播帶貨，由下午3點直播到翌日凌晨3點。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>吳千語直播帶貨至凌晨4點返家　驚見豪宅震撼玫瑰花海</p><p>片中所見，豪宅的樓梯、走廊及玄關位置，鋪滿了數以千計的粉紅色與白色的鮮玫瑰花海，搭配兩個巨大的歐式白瓷花樽，整體氣派奢華又不失浪漫優雅。剛結束長時間直播帶貨的吳千語，身穿白色長袖上衣及卡其色短褲，手上還拿著保溫水壺。當她推開家門看見滿屋花海時，驚訝到一度用手遮嘴！</p><figure><img alt=\"凌晨4點返家驚見豪宅震撼玫瑰花海。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189620271448330240514263.png/EAnHfm-wGJJZ4B7-AKqxAcn7lxRpMRqDfDmqBXw5qgU\"/><figcaption>凌晨4點返家驚見豪宅震撼玫瑰花海。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"凌晨4點返家驚見豪宅震撼玫瑰花海。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189620268919033856379684.png/47nzI2uDXcu0L_l3SrkILfQbVMXxVC5WDBw6bQwcOm0\"/><figcaption>凌晨4點返家驚見豪宅震撼玫瑰花海。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生日驚喜。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189620266482012160862039.png/eXK1FlrF6Gf0lDwjVbslKFOh39YwHCrP8L6fcfC-n3E\"/><figcaption>生日驚喜。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生日驚喜。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189620263751389184361904.png/8kZE7goFqV9uVfpcopS0aiE0Ds2fEind6q3h2-qt4ds\"/><figcaption>生日驚喜。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"玫瑰花海。（影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189620261159178240897403.jpeg/a7Vlpokml6_fFKdHdRK5efvekvT-qBCubzzXJ2881yc\"/><figcaption>玫瑰花海。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>馬天佑麥少瑜暗中策劃生日驚喜　吳千語：以為有人求婚</p><p>吳千語於IG限時動態中寫道：「Walked in the house with this, I thought someone's proposing. Turns out my friends just love me. No 💍, still crying.（一走進屋裡看到這樣，我還以為有人求婚。原來只是我的朋友們太愛我了。雖然沒有戒指，但我依然感動得哭了！）」</p><figure><img alt=\"氣派！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189619086074712064728539.jpeg/XW610FuTf5P9fghPwV731-bSEpDUe1r0Y2lSLmNpUi4\"/><figcaption>氣派！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"氣派！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189619083566387200623015.jpeg/zx68B8-Unei6agWZ8oANJcg2o7TFAbWQscFh6bHBYek\"/><figcaption>氣派！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吳千語參與愛巢設計。（小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260611/1141689820813201408567918.jpeg/iJgYI-sWVFSI_5pDE1nO4YUm_QP4xAgv3KhxW9yocVs\"/><figcaption>吳千語參與愛巢設計。（小紅書影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"客廳。（小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260611/1141690542103465984564378.jpeg/HeDG1pDZrkAum1asHvDFRLkyLstCf2MXpRo6wqUaOsI\"/><figcaption>客廳。（小紅書影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"西廚。（小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260611/1141690984854196224078156.jpeg/BmzXqbYLcFwIJ1_vyvT7WWixgAY9-Rtu-SKj6fkio-k\"/><figcaption>西廚。（小紅書影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"主臥。（小紅書影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260611/1141691367886426112659871.jpeg/C0dpAOJiA5B8W-K-riS_j5HLfdZ-gTiD-t-Oefrfjnk\"/><figcaption>主臥。（小紅書影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>四人相識多年成超級摯友　網民羨慕：神仙友誼！</p><p>吳千語與馬天佑（Mayao）、麥少瑜（Fiona）及Tiffany Poon（潘美諺）相識多年一向私交甚篤，更是超級摯友。2024年吳千語與施伯雄在意大利莊園舉行婚禮時，三人都是姊妹團之一，見證好友出嫁。今次三人在吳千語工作期間，偷偷安排花藝師進入其豪宅精心佈置，打造出夢幻花海，足見四人的「神仙友誼」！</p><figure><img alt=\"2024年吳千語與施伯雄在意大利莊園舉行婚禮時，三人都是姊妹團之一，見證好友出嫁。（IG@karena_ngs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189622014718251008590416.jpeg/j3AcsjOw86oLoPOB5ReMCgAVHRd9qZcl8bRJo_G0SaM\"/><figcaption>2024年吳千語與施伯雄在意大利莊園舉行婚禮時，三人都是姊妹團之一，見證好友出嫁。（IG@karena_ngs）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"意大利婚禮。（IG@karena_ngs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189623048467124224075498.jpeg/a7C-HNdHQoPCmLn9Qkosozvm1nN7c-zvOLf6YTi3-mE\"/><figcaption>意大利婚禮。（IG@karena_ngs）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"經常一起去旅行。（IG@karena_ngs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189622011631112192025719.jpeg/ONlEzN33yoSG0W4DrJfZGzHOvEDnDpTWuWC04rlgtOI\"/><figcaption>經常一起去旅行。（IG@karena_ngs）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"經常一起去旅行。（IG@karena_ngs）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189622009236033536509483.jpeg/KjNRuEA1tZ3dqNRPTTeSEksDQRxLC56DpEpY9KRKWPQ\"/><figcaption>經常一起去旅行。（IG@karena_ngs）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T23:21:49.179557+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1267,"images":22,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:00:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T03:58:35.116336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T23:17:39.939429+00:00","content_hash":"b9954acf6a36a0a707306d4291820f5f48fada8fa1a1df7831f516f3be144c36","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}